  "description": "After his mother’s death, Subin grows disgusted with his father, who quickly remarries a much younger woman. Living with his new stepmother, Eunjung, he develops complicated feelings for her. As he begins to see traces of his mother in Eunjung, his feelings grow into a desire to save her from his father…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/between_the_doors), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/between_the_doors)",
